<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The Appearance / Layout editor's bottom area (appearance-layout-editor SPEC §3.1–3.6): a
     non-modal M3 sheet docked at the foot of android.R.id.content. AppearanceEditorPanel paints
     its fill (colorSurfaceContainer) and its top corners (shapeAppearanceCornerExtraLarge);
     SurfaceEditorController adds the navigation inset to the bottom padding and sets the height:
     AppearanceEditorPanel.measureFor(mode), measured from the rows that mode shows, held to the
     sheet reserve (AppearancePreviewArea: the tallest of the three pages, the Custom row
     included, as far as the preview's least scale allows), so the sheet's top edge and the
     preview above it stand still on every page and stop. The rows hang from the top; a page
     whose rows are shorter shows plain sheet under them. Only Row B scrolls, and only where it
     is taller than the sheet; nothing in it is weighted.

     One ConstraintLayout. Each mode's rows are a Group
     (appearance_editor_appearance_group / appearance_editor_layout_group), and a mode switch
     shows one Group and hides the other.

     The sheet follows the locale's direction (it is reading-order UI, docked full width, so
     nothing about where it sits changes), though the content root it is added to is pinned left
     to right.

     There is no top row: the Look | Layout mode pill is the page bar's title while this sheet is
     up (appearance_page_frame, AppearanceEditorPage), and Undo and Done are the bar's end actions,
     so the sheet starts at its first row and has no top padding.

     Appearance rows. Row A: the Look slider, a label centred under each of its five stops (placed
     in code: the stops sit inside the slider's track padding, so equal-width labels would drift
     off them). Row B (the Custom stop only): a heading row, 48dp tall, then up to five vertical
     Material 3 sliders (LegendSlider, 40dp track, the legend beside it) in equal columns.
     The heading is the selection's name ("All surfaces" for nothing tapped) and leads the row;
     the buttons the selection has follow it (Keyboard theme; Clock), each 48dp tall and 8dp
     apart. The terminal has no name there: its two pills (Cursor trail, Terminal effect; a
     heading over the chosen option) share the whole row. The sliders are one fixed length, so the sheet is the same height for
     every selection; Row B is GONE at a Look stop. Sets, top to bottom of each legend:
       nothing  Blur, Grain, Opacity, Margin, Corner radius
       keyboard Blur, Grain, Opacity, Key radius, Key spacing   (button: Keyboard theme)
       dock     Blur, Grain, Opacity, Size, App icons
       terminal Blur, Grain, Opacity, Contrast                  (pills: Cursor trail, Terminal effect)
       status   Blur, Grain, Opacity                            (button: Clock)

     Layout rows (layout editor v2, DECISIONS items 2, 3 and 10). Row A: Orientation (two 48dp
     icon segments), Style (two 48dp icon segments), and eye-off at the end: the only drop target
     for hiding, the toggle of the hidden tiles, and the count badge's anchor. Behind it a 64dp
     highlight, larger than its 48dp target, shows while a lifted bar may be dropped on it. Row B:
     Corner radius and Margin as two equal columns, each a label above its slider; while the hidden
     tiles are open they stand in Row B's place, one line of chips (it pans sideways when five
     elements are hidden at 360dp), so the sheet never changes height. While the keyboard is
     selected its tools take the same place: the three type chips, then Key radius (a label above
     its slider) in the rest of the row. The tiles win while both would. No hint text anywhere.

     Width arithmetic, dp. Sheet padding 16 + 16, so the content width is W - 32.
       (The mode pill is the page bar's title: 40dp segments, centred in the bar's title slot;
       see appearance_page_frame. Widget.Termux.Button.Segment pads all four sides 12dp.)
       Appearance Row A: the slider spans W - 32 (328 / 379 / 501); five LabelMedium words, the
         widest "Custom" ≈ 44, under stops (W - 32 - 2 × track padding) / 4 apart: ≥ 70 at 360.
       Appearance Row B: five columns, four 12dp gaps: (W - 32 - 48) / 5 = 56 / 66.2 / 88.6, each
         wider than the 40dp track; fewer columns share the same width equally.
       Layout Row A: 96 + 8 + 96 + gap + 48 = 248 + gap; gap 80 / 131 / 253. The 64dp highlight
         is centred on eye-off: 8dp of it stand past the button's end, inside the sheet's 16dp
         padding.
       Layout Row B: two columns, one 16dp gap: 156 / 181.5 / 242.5; "Corner radius · 40 dp"
         (LabelMedium) ≈ 120 ≤ 156 at the default text size; at Large it wraps to two lines,
         and a Barrier under both labels keeps the sliders level.
       Keyboard tools in Row B: three 48dp-tall chips (24dp glyph + 4 + 4 + chip padding ≈ 50
         each, 4dp apart) ≈ 158, 16 gap, Key radius in the rest: 154 / 205 / 327;
         "Key radius · 24 dp" ≈ 105 ≤ 154. Height: label 16 + slider 48 = 64, the chips' 48
         centred on the slider: the row's own 64.

     Heights, dp, without the navigation inset (the controller adds it to the bottom padding):
       Appearance: Row A (slider 48 + labels 16 = 64) + 8
                   + Row B (heading row 48 + 8 + sliders 168 = 224) + 16 = 312 (Row A alone: 80).
       Layout:     Row A 48 + 8 + Row B (label 16 + slider 48 = 64) + 16 = 136.
     The controller uses the measured heights, not these numbers. -->
<androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto"
    android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_panel"
    android:layoutDirection="locale"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
    android:clickable="true"
    android:focusable="false"
    android:paddingStart="16dp"
    android:paddingTop="0dp"
    android:paddingEnd="16dp"
    android:paddingBottom="16dp"
    app:layout_optimizationLevel="none">

    <!-- ============================================================ Icons mode -->

    <!-- Icons mode's one row: the pack tiles and "Pinned app icons only", lent by the activity
         (AppearanceEditorPanel.setIconsContent). GONE in the other modes; the sheet is as tall
         as this content (plus the bottom padding and the navigation inset). -->
    <FrameLayout
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_icons_slot"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:paddingTop="8dp"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent" />

    <!-- ============================================================ Appearance mode -->

    <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_look"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_look_description"
        android:stepSize="1"
        android:value="4"
        android:valueFrom="0"
        android:valueTo="4"
        app:labelBehavior="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent"
        app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

    <!-- One label per stop, centred under it in code. -->
    <FrameLayout
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_look_labels"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_look" />

    <!-- Row B: a heading row over the Custom row's vertical sliders. GONE until Look mode is at
         the Custom stop (the global set shows with nothing tapped). Code fills it: the heading,
         the buttons the selection has, and up to five LegendSliders (AppearanceLooks.controls).
         The sheet is one height on every page and stop (AppearancePreviewArea's reserve); where
         that is shorter than Row B (a short phone, Large text) Row B scrolls inside it rather
         than the sheet growing. A slider keeps its own drag (it claims the touch on down), so
         the row scrolls from its heading and the gaps. -->
    <ScrollView
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
        android:overScrollMode="never"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constrainedHeight="true"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_look_labels"
        app:layout_constraintVertical_bias="0">

    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2_content"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:orientation="vertical">

        <!-- The heading row: one height for every selection (48dp, or the terminal's two-line
             pills where they are taller: the panel reserves it), so the sheet is one height
             whatever is selected. The name leads (it gives way first); the buttons keep their
             size, 8dp apart. -->
        <LinearLayout
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2_head"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:gravity="center_vertical"
            android:minHeight="48dp"
            android:orientation="horizontal">

            <TextView
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2_name"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:ellipsize="end"
                android:maxWidth="132dp"
                android:maxLines="1"
                android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelLarge"
                android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />

            <!-- Pushes a lone door (Keyboard theme, Clock) to the row's end; GONE while the
                 terminal's two pills share the row's width. -->
            <Space
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_row2_space"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="1dp"
                android:layout_weight="1" />

            <!-- The keyboard's door to its theme page (DECISIONS item 15). -->
            <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_door_keyboard_theme"
                style="@style/Widget.Material3.Button.TonalButton.Icon"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="48dp"
                android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
                android:ellipsize="end"
                android:maxLines="1"
                android:minWidth="0dp"
                android:paddingStart="12dp"
                android:paddingEnd="12dp"
                android:text="@string/appearance_editor_keyboard_theme"
                android:visibility="gone"
                app:icon="@drawable/ic_settings_chevron_right"
                app:iconGravity="end"
                app:iconPadding="4dp"
                app:iconSize="18dp" />

            <!-- The status bar's clock: opens the face and position popup upward from here. -->
            <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_door_clock"
                style="@style/Widget.Material3.Button.TonalButton"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="48dp"
                android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
                android:contentDescription="@string/termux_surface_tuning_clock_open"
                android:maxLines="1"
                android:minWidth="0dp"
                android:text="@string/appearance_editor_clock"
                android:visibility="gone" />

            <!-- The terminal's two pills, Cursor trail and Terminal effect: each a heading over
                 the chosen option, opening a menu of the choices. They own the heading row (the
                 name is GONE for the terminal) and share it equally, 8dp apart; Terminal effect is
                 GONE below API 33, and Cursor trail then takes the whole row. Each line is one
                 line, ellipsized; the panel reserves their height for every selection's heading
                 row (AppearanceEditorPanel.reserveHeadingHeight), so Row B is one height. -->
            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_trail"
                style="@style/Widget.Material3.CardView.Outlined"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:clickable="true"
                android:focusable="true"
                android:minHeight="48dp"
                android:visibility="gone"
                app:cardBackgroundColor="@android:color/transparent"
                app:shapeAppearance="?attr/shapeAppearanceCornerLarge"
                app:strokeColor="?attr/colorOutline">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_gravity="center_vertical"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:paddingStart="12dp"
                    android:paddingTop="4dp"
                    android:paddingEnd="8dp"
                    android:paddingBottom="4dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_trail_title"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:ellipsize="end"
                        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/appearance_editor_trail_title"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold"
                        android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface" />

                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:orientation="horizontal">

                        <TextView
                            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_trail_value"
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:ellipsize="end"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            android:maxLines="1"
                            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceBodySmall"
                            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />

                        <ImageView
                            android:layout_width="16dp"
                            android:layout_height="16dp"
                            android:layout_marginStart="4dp"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            android:src="@drawable/ic_arrow_drop_down_16"
                            app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />
                    </LinearLayout>
                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>

            <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_effect"
                style="@style/Widget.Material3.CardView.Outlined"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:clickable="true"
                android:focusable="true"
                android:minHeight="48dp"
                android:visibility="gone"
                app:cardBackgroundColor="@android:color/transparent"
                app:shapeAppearance="?attr/shapeAppearanceCornerLarge"
                app:strokeColor="?attr/colorOutline">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:layout_width="match_parent"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_gravity="center_vertical"
                    android:orientation="vertical"
                    android:paddingStart="12dp"
                    android:paddingTop="4dp"
                    android:paddingEnd="8dp"
                    android:paddingBottom="4dp">

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_effect_title"
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:ellipsize="end"
                        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                        android:maxLines="1"
                        android:text="@string/appearance_editor_effect_title"
                        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceTitleSmall"
                        android:textStyle="bold"
                        android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurface" />

                    <LinearLayout
                        android:layout_width="match_parent"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:gravity="center_vertical"
                        android:orientation="horizontal">

                        <TextView
                            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_effect_value"
                            android:layout_width="0dp"
                            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                            android:layout_weight="1"
                            android:ellipsize="end"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            android:maxLines="1"
                            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceBodySmall"
                            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />

                        <ImageView
                            android:layout_width="16dp"
                            android:layout_height="16dp"
                            android:layout_marginStart="4dp"
                            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                            android:src="@drawable/ic_arrow_drop_down_16"
                            app:tint="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant" />
                    </LinearLayout>
                </LinearLayout>
            </com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView>
        </LinearLayout>

        <!-- The sliders: equal columns 12dp apart (the gaps are set in code, so a hidden column
             leaves none), all one fixed height. -->
        <LinearLayout
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_sliders"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="@dimen/appearance_editor_slider_length"
            android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
            android:orientation="horizontal">

            <com.termux.app.surfaces.LegendSlider
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_slider_0"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
                android:visibility="gone" />

            <com.termux.app.surfaces.LegendSlider
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_slider_1"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
                android:visibility="gone" />

            <com.termux.app.surfaces.LegendSlider
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_slider_2"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
                android:visibility="gone" />

            <com.termux.app.surfaces.LegendSlider
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_slider_3"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
                android:visibility="gone" />

            <com.termux.app.surfaces.LegendSlider
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_slider_4"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
                android:visibility="gone" />

            <com.termux.app.surfaces.LegendSlider
                android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_slider_5"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="match_parent"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_control_description"
                android:visibility="gone" />
        </LinearLayout>
    </LinearLayout>
    </ScrollView>

    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Group
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_appearance_group"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        app:constraint_referenced_ids="appearance_editor_look,appearance_editor_look_labels" />

    <!-- ================================================================ Layout mode -->

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_orientation"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
        android:contentDescription="@string/termux_layout_editor_orientation"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent"
        app:selectionRequired="true"
        app:singleSelection="true">

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_orientation_portrait"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_orientation_portrait"
            android:tooltipText="@string/settings_layout_orientation_portrait"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_portrait"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_orientation_landscape"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_orientation_landscape"
            android:tooltipText="@string/settings_layout_orientation_landscape"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_landscape"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />
    </com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup>

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_style"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginStart="8dp"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_style_description"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation"
        app:selectionRequired="true"
        app:singleSelection="true">

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_style_docked"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_style_docked"
            android:tooltipText="@string/appearance_editor_style_docked"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_docked"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />

        <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
            android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_style_floating"
            style="@style/Widget.Termux.Button.Segment"
            android:layout_width="48dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:minWidth="0dp"
            android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_style_floating"
            android:tooltipText="@string/appearance_editor_style_floating"
            app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_floating"
            app:iconPadding="0dp"
            app:iconSize="24dp" />
    </com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButtonToggleGroup>

    <!-- Eye-off's drop highlight: 64dp, larger than the 48dp target it stands behind, shown
         (INVISIBLE otherwise, so it never moves anything) only while a lifted element may be
         put away. Its rect is the drop area LayoutEditorController gives the canvas. -->
    <View
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden_highlight"
        android:layout_width="64dp"
        android:layout_height="64dp"
        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
        android:visibility="invisible"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_hidden" />

    <!-- Eye-off (DECISIONS items 2 and 3): the only drop target a lifted bar is put away in, and
         a tap opens or closes the hidden tiles. Its count badge is attached in code, after it is
         laid out, and is absent while nothing is hidden. -->
    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden"
        style="?attr/materialIconButtonStyle"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/layout_editor_hidden_none"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:icon="@drawable/ic_layout_hide"
        app:iconSize="24dp"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation" />

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="8dp"
        android:ellipsize="end"
        android:maxLines="2"
        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
        android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        app:layout_constraintHorizontal_chainStyle="spread"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_orientation" />

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginStart="16dp"
        android:ellipsize="end"
        android:maxLines="2"
        android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
        android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label" />

    <!-- Under the two labels: the sliders hang from it, so they line up whichever label wraps. -->
    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Barrier
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_layout_barrier"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        app:barrierDirection="bottom"
        app:constraint_referenced_ids="appearance_editor_corners_label,appearance_editor_margin_label" />

    <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_corners"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_corners_description"
        android:stepSize="1"
        android:valueFrom="0"
        android:valueTo="40"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:labelBehavior="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_layout_barrier"
        app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

    <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_margin"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:contentDescription="@string/appearance_editor_margin_description"
        android:stepSize="1"
        android:valueFrom="0"
        android:valueTo="48"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:labelBehavior="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/appearance_editor_margin_label"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_layout_barrier"
        app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />

    <!-- The hidden tiles (DECISIONS item 3): one chip per hidden element, each with the restore
         arrow; a tap brings it back to its last edge, a drag onto the canvas to the edge it is
         dropped on. While open they stand where Corner radius and Margin are, which are hidden
         meanwhile, so the sheet keeps its height. -->
    <HorizontalScrollView
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden_tiles"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:fillViewport="false"
        android:scrollbars="none"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label">

        <com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_hidden_tile_group"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/layout_editor_hidden_tiles_description"
            app:chipSpacingHorizontal="8dp"
            app:singleLine="true" />
    </HorizontalScrollView>

    <!-- The keyboard's tools (DECISIONS item 6): while the keyboard is selected they stand where
         Corner radius and Margin are, which are hidden meanwhile (the hidden tiles' swap), so the
         sheet keeps its height. The three type chips at the start, centred on Key radius's
         slider; Key radius takes the rest of the row, a label above its slider. The row is pinned to
         Corner radius's extent (the 48dp chips stand a little past the slider, unclipped), so the
         sheet is the same height either way. -->
    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout
        android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_tools"
        android:layout_width="0dp"
        android:layout_height="0dp"
        android:clipChildren="false"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners"
        app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
        app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/appearance_editor_corners_label">

        <com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_forms"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            app:chipSpacingHorizontal="4dp"
            app:chipSpacingVertical="4dp"
            app:layout_constraintBottom_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius"
            app:selectionRequired="true"
            app:singleLine="true"
            app:singleSelection="true">

            <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_form_docked"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.LayoutEditor.KeyboardFormChip"
                android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_keyboard_form_docked"
                app:chipIcon="@drawable/ic_symbol_keyboard_docked"
                app:chipIconSize="24dp" />

            <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_form_floating"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.LayoutEditor.KeyboardFormChip"
                android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_keyboard_form_floating"
                app:chipIcon="@drawable/ic_symbol_keyboard_floating"
                app:chipIconSize="24dp" />

            <com.google.android.material.chip.Chip
                android:id="@+id/layout_editor_keyboard_form_split"
                style="@style/Widget.Termux.LayoutEditor.KeyboardFormChip"
                android:contentDescription="@string/settings_layout_keyboard_form_split"
                app:chipIcon="@drawable/ic_symbol_keyboard_split"
                app:chipIconSize="24dp" />
        </com.google.android.material.chip.ChipGroup>

        <!-- Key radius: the key caps' radius, moved here from Look mode (DECISIONS item 6). -->
        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginStart="16dp"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:importantForAccessibility="no"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:textAppearance="?attr/textAppearanceLabelMedium"
            android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="parent"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_keyboard_forms"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toTopOf="parent" />

        <com.google.android.material.slider.Slider
            android:id="@+id/layout_editor_key_radius"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:contentDescription="@string/layout_editor_key_radius_description"
            android:stepSize="1"
            android:valueFrom="0"
            android:valueTo="24"
            app:labelBehavior="gone"
            app:layout_constraintEnd_toEndOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            app:layout_constraintStart_toStartOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            app:layout_constraintTop_toBottomOf="@id/layout_editor_key_radius_label"
            app:tickVisibilityMode="hidden" />
    </androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>

    <!-- Row A's members only: Row B (Corner radius and Margin, or the hidden tiles in their place)
         is shown in code, since a Group restates its members' visibility on every layout pass. -->
    <androidx.constraintlayout.widget.Group
        android:id="@+id/appearance_editor_layout_group"
        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:visibility="gone"
        app:constraint_referenced_ids="layout_editor_orientation,appearance_editor_style,layout_editor_hidden" />
</androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout>
